      "summary": "Embracing Digital Transformation Embracing Digital Home Guidance Briefings (EDTW) What changed Interviews (EDT) How others did it Architectural Deep Dives What to do next Learn Digital Transformation Overview Pillars AI, Cyber, Data, Edge, Computing, Comms ODXA Domains &amp; mappings Whitepapers Monthly canonical synthesis Articles Explainers &amp; analysis Lectures (DTA) Learning series Intelligence Community Community Newsletter Patreon LinkedIn About About Host Sponsors Shop Search Sebastian Wernicke LinkedIn Profile Biography Using data and AI to transform businesses by asking not just \"What?\" and \"How much?\", but also \"What if?\" and \"Why?\". I guide companies beyond merely being data-driven to building cultures where data sparks innovation, challenges assumptions, and delivers breakthrough results. As a hands-on practitioner with over 15 years of experience, I have built and led high-performance data teams across Europe and the U.S. Working with a diverse range of clients—from agile startups to government organizations and Fortune 500 corporations—I help organizations generate transformative value by making data a true strategic asset. I believe the key to unlocking data’s power lies in understanding human psychology and fostering an evidence-based culture. I enjoy making these often-complex concepts accessible and actionable. My TED Talks have reached over 5 million viewers, and I've given invited talks at Stanford, Wharton Unilever, Mars, Red Bull, Hugo Boss, Munich Re and many other interesting places. My best-selling book \"Data Inspired\" (German edition) explores how to build a culture of evidence-based decision making. A completely updated English edition is forthcoming in 2026! Latest Episodes Put the title Right Here Data can inform a decision, but it can’t replace leadership. Dr. Darren sits down with Dr. Sebastian Vinicky, author of *Data Inspired*, to explore how digital transformation, AI, and data-driven decision-making really w… Copyright &copy; Pai",
